# ios TREES — the embedder's whole-dir mirror roots, DECLARED here and
# materialized into hosts/ios/Tools/gen_bundle_header.py by
# tools/gen-staging-emit.mjs. `<bundle-rel>=<source-rel>` embeds the DSH-rooted
# directory tree at the bundle-relative prefix (identity rows spell both
# sides); the npm-face rows stage published-tarball bytes at the vendor/dsh/
# rel path the preset-health marker seeders walk. Row order = block order (the
# tree walk consumes it). A new pin is a hand row here; a new FILE inside an
# existing tree needs no row (the embedder rglobs each root), and graph
# coverage of everything no root covers stays with check-staging's ios
# surface (blocking, earlier in the DAG).
# The vendored spine pins: verbatim lib/ trees (the loader's
# vendor/dsh/<pkg>@<ver>/lib/** map) — the D9 spine, the Agent 预设 closure,
# the FILE-TOOLS rows, the SKILL family.
